				<text><![CDATA[<b>NB:</b> If you realise that some of the information is incorrectly captured on this Registration Confirmation Letter, do not hesitate to contact the Learning Programmes unit at <b>011 547 2600</b>.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
